    <briefdescription>
<para>A single profile snapshot captured by the continuous profiler. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput>data</computeroutput> field holds the profile in the pprof folded-stacks text format (one stack per line, space-separated frames, followed by a sample count). This format is directly consumable by:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>go tool pprof</computeroutput></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>flamegraph.pl</computeroutput> (Brendan Gregg)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>async-profiler&apos;s flamegraph output pipeline </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
